Spanish verb paradigms in spa-conj.json are derived from the Kaikki.org
Spanish verb extract (https://kaikki.org/dictionary/Spanish/pos-verb/),
produced by Wiktextract from English Wiktionary.

Source download (preferred):
https://kaikki.org/dictionary/Spanish/pos-verb/kaikki.org-dictionary-Spanish-by-pos-verb.jsonl.gz

License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

(Wiktionary content is dual-licensed CC BY-SA and GFDL; Kaikki redistributes
the Wiktextract JSON under CC BY-SA.)

Adaptations in this file: finite indicative and subjunctive forms, the
affirmative and negative imperative, the gerund, and the masculine singular
past participle only; clitic-combined forms and multiword verbs dropped;
voseo duplicates dropped in favor of tuteo (tú / vosotros); paradigms kept
only when the infinitive is also a headword in the bundled FreeDict spa-deu
dictionary (verb POS, untagged, or infinitive-shaped noun/verb homographs
such as poder).

Attribute Kaikki.org / Wiktextract and the English Wiktionary contributors.
Share adaptations of this file under the same CC BY-SA license.

The previous UniMorph-based build (CC BY-SA 3.0) can still be reproduced with
`go run ./cmd/convertconj -format unimorph …` if needed.
